WEBVTT

00:00:00.103 --> 00:00:05.722
Setting up finance accounts

00:00:05.772 --> 00:00:09.861
Open Finance, then Accounts, and go to Manage Accounts.

00:00:13.620 --> 00:00:15.500
Press Add Account.

00:00:17.370 --> 00:00:24.973
Enter the account name and choose its type: Cash, Bank or Person. Then enter the opening balance.

00:00:27.819 --> 00:00:32.133
Keep Visible to Staff ticked if staff members should see this account.

00:00:32.620 --> 00:00:41.353
Press Save. The new account appears in the list. Create at least one Cash and one Bank account before collecting fees.

00:00:44.766 --> 00:00:49.450
Account created
